  "instructions": [
    "Heat a medium saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Melt butter in the saucepan.",
    "Add cinnamon and cream and cook, stirring occasionally, until cream is warm.",
    "Remove from heat and stir in ricotta cheese.",
    "Roughly chop pecans.",
    "To serve, transfer to a bowl and sprinkle with cinnamon and pecans."
